# Build context of Dockerfile.portal (#273): the repo root, minus everything the
# portal build does not read. Docker uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over .dockerignore.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
dist
coverage
.git
.github

# Never let a developer's credentials into an image layer (#185).
**/.env
**/.env.*

.iris
secrets
__tests__
plans
docs
deploy
docker
# Not apps/portal/e2e or __tests__: `next build` type-checks them (tsconfig **/*.ts).
apps/portal/test-results
apps/portal/playwright-report
*.log
